<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Site Under Construction</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #121212;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .image-placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 165, 0, 0.3);
            border: 4px solid #FFA500; /* Safety Orange */
            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; /* Maintains consistent visual space */
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1e1e, #333); /* Basic loading gradient */
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* 
           This SVG serves as a stylised placeholder 
           for the requested image of Black women 
           construction workers.
        */
        .image-placeholder svg {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            fill: #FFA500;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #FFA500; /* Safety Orange */
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #cccccc;
        }

        .loader {
            border: 8px solid #333;
            border-top: 8px solid #FFA500;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #666666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Stylized Placeholder for Image -->
        <div class="image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M12 2l2.4 7.2h7.6l-6 4.8 2.4 7.2-6-4.8-6 4.8 2.4-7.2-6-4.8h7.6z"/>
            </svg>
            <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 10px;">[Image: Black Women Construction Crew]</div>
        </div>

        <h1>Under Construction</h1>
        <p>Our team of expert engineers at Sentinel Paradise are currently building something amazing. We are busy laying the foundation and polishing the details to bring you a brand new digital experience. Thanks for your patience the academy will launch soon!</p>
        
        <div class="loader"></div>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2026 Sntinel Academy. All Rights Reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
